{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07363","headline":"落第赠杨侍御兼拜员外仍充安大夫判官赴范阳 · 刘长卿","name":"落第赠杨侍御兼拜员外仍充安大夫判官赴范阳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"职副旌旄重，才兼识量通。\n使车遥肃物，边策远和戎。\n掷地金声着，从军宝劒雄。\n官成稽古力，名达济时功。\n肃穆乌台上，雍容粉署中。\n含香初待漏，持简旧生风。\n黠吏偏惊隼，贪夫辄避骢。\n且知荣已隔，谁谓道仍同。\n念旧追连茹，谋生任转蓬。\n泣连三献玉，疮惧再伤弓。\n恋土函关外，瞻尘灞水东。\n他时书一札，犹冀问途穷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07363.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07363","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}